This repository is a public page for recruiting contributors to Meetrail. It
contains no application source code and is NOT open source.

1. OWNERSHIP
   All copyright and other intellectual property rights in the text, images
   (including screenshots), and other content in this repository belong to the
   copyright holders named above.

2. PERMITTED USE
   You may (a) view the contents of this repository, and (b) quote from it with
   attribution, within the scope of quotation permitted by the Japanese
   Copyright Act, Article 32.

3. PROHIBITED USE
   Without prior written permission (including by email) from the copyright
   holders, you may not, whether for commercial or non-commercial purposes:
   (a) reproduce or republish the whole or a substantial part of this
   repository; (b) redistribute or modify its images; or (c) use its contents as
   material for a service targeting any other idol group, artist, or event.

4. TRADEMARKS
   The names, logos, and icons "ミトレル" and "Meetrail" belong to the copyright
   holders. This license grants no right to use them.

5. THE APPLICATION ITSELF
   The source code, design documents, database schema, and design assets of
   Meetrail are private and governed by a proprietary license. If you join the
   project, materials you contribute are treated as granting the copyright
   holders a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free right to use, reproduce, modify,
   sublicense, and distribute them as part of the software.

6. NO WARRANTY
   The contents of this repository are provided "as is", without warranty of
   accuracy or completeness, and may change without notice.

7. GOVERNING LAW
   This license is governed by the laws of Japan. The Tokyo District Court shall
